{"id":235,"slug":"235-function-composition-la-gi","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Functions","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Function composition là gì?","question_en":"What is function composition?","answer_vi":"Function composition là **ghép nhiều hàm nhỏ thành một hàm lớn**, đầu ra của hàm này là đầu vào của hàm kế tiếp.\n\n```javascript\nconst compose = (...fns) => (x) => fns.reduceRight((v, f) => f(v), x)\nconst pipe    = (...fns) => (x) => fns.reduce((v, f) => f(v), x)\n```\n\nHai cái chỉ khác **chiều đọc**:\n\n```javascript\nconst trim       = (s) => s.trim()\nconst lower      = (s) => s.toLowerCase()\nconst slugify    = (s) => s.replace(/\\s+/g, '-')\n\ncompose(slugify, lower, trim)(' Học React ')   // đọc từ PHẢI sang trái\npipe(trim, lower, slugify)(' Học React ')      // đọc từ TRÁI sang phải — dễ hơn\n// → 'học-react'\n```\n\nLợi ích so với biến trung gian:\n\n```javascript\n// không compose\nconst a = trim(input)\nconst b = lower(a)\nconst c = slugify(b)\n\n// compose: đặt tên cho cả pipeline, tái dùng được\nconst toSlug = pipe(trim, lower, slugify)\ntitles.map(toSlug)\n```\n\nGặp ở đâu trong thực tế: `applyMiddleware` của Redux, chuỗi transform của RxJS, plugin của PostCSS/Babel.\n\n**Lưu ý 1:** mỗi hàm trong chuỗi phải **nhận đúng một tham số**. Hàm nhiều tham số phải curry trước.\n\n**Lưu ý 2:** compose chỉ chạy đồng bộ. Có bước bất đồng bộ thì cần bản riêng:\n\n```javascript\nconst pipeAsync = (...fns) => (x) => fns.reduce((p, f) => p.then(f), Promise.resolve(x))\n```","answer_en":"Function composition **chains small functions into a bigger one**, where each output feeds the next input.\n\n```javascript\nconst compose = (...fns) => (x) => fns.reduceRight((v, f) => f(v), x)\nconst pipe    = (...fns) => (x) => fns.reduce((v, f) => f(v), x)\n```\n\nThey differ only in **reading direction**:\n\n```javascript\nconst trim       = (s) => s.trim()\nconst lower      = (s) => s.toLowerCase()\nconst slugify    = (s) => s.replace(/\\s+/g, '-')\n\ncompose(slugify, lower, trim)(' Learn React ')   // reads RIGHT to left\npipe(trim, lower, slugify)(' Learn React ')      // reads LEFT to right — easier\n// -> 'learn-react'\n```\n\nWhy it beats intermediate variables:\n\n```javascript\n// without composition\nconst a = trim(input)\nconst b = lower(a)\nconst c = slugify(b)\n\n// with composition: the pipeline gets a name and can be reused\nconst toSlug = pipe(trim, lower, slugify)\ntitles.map(toSlug)\n```\n\nWhere it shows up in practice: Redux `applyMiddleware`, RxJS operator chains, PostCSS/Babel plugin pipelines.\n\n**Note 1:** every function in the chain must **take exactly one argument**. Multi-argument functions have to be curried first.\n\n**Note 2:** plain composition is synchronous. An async step needs its own version:\n\n```javascript\nconst pipeAsync = (...fns) => (x) => fns.reduce((p, f) => p.then(f), Promise.resolve(x))\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p>Function composition là <strong>ghép nhiều hàm nhỏ thành một hàm lớn</strong>, đầu ra của hàm này là đầu vào của hàm kế tiếp.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const compose = (...fns) =&gt; (x) =&gt; fns.reduceRight((v, f) =&gt; f(v), x)\nconst pipe    = (...fns) =&gt; (x) =&gt; fns.reduce((v, f) =&gt; f(v), x)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">compose</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">...fns</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span>) =&gt;</span> fns.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reduceRight</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">v, f</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span>(v), x)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">pipe</span>    = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">...fns</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span>) =&gt;</span> fns.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reduce</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">v, f</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span>(v), x)</code></pre></div><p>Hai cái chỉ khác <strong>chiều đọc</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const trim       = (s) =&gt; s.trim()\nconst lower      = (s) =&gt; s.toLowerCase()\nconst slugify    = (s) =&gt; s.replace(/\\s+/g, '-')\n\ncompose(slugify, lower, trim)(' Học React ')   // đọc từ PHẢI sang trái\npipe(trim, lower, slugify)(' Học React ')      // đọc từ TRÁI sang phải — dễ hơn\n// → 'học-react'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>       = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">s</span>) =&gt; s.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">lower</span>      = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">s</span>) =&gt; s.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toLowerCase</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">slugify</span>    = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">s</span>) =&gt; s.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replace</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/\\s+/g</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">compose</span>(slugify, lower, trim)(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27; Học React &#x27;</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// đọc từ PHẢI sang trái</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">pipe</span>(trim, lower, slugify)(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27; Học React &#x27;</span>)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// đọc từ TRÁI sang phải — dễ hơn</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// → &#x27;học-react&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p>Lợi ích so với biến trung gian:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// không compose\nconst a = trim(input)\nconst b = lower(a)\nconst c = slugify(b)\n\n// compose: đặt tên cho cả pipeline, tái dùng được\nconst toSlug = pipe(trim, lower, slugify)\ntitles.map(toSlug)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// không compose</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> a = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>(input)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> b = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">lower</span>(a)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> c = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">slugify</span>(b)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// compose: đặt tên cho cả pipeline, tái dùng được</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> toSlug = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">pipe</span>(trim, lower, slugify)\ntitles.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(toSlug)</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Gặp ở đâu trong thực tế: <code>applyMiddleware</code> của Redux, chuỗi transform của RxJS, plugin của PostCSS/Babel.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 1:</strong> mỗi hàm trong chuỗi phải <strong>nhận đúng một tham số</strong>. Hàm nhiều tham số phải curry trước.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý 2:</strong> compose chỉ chạy đồng bộ. Có bước bất đồng bộ thì cần bản riêng:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const pipeAsync = (...fns) =&gt; (x) =&gt; fns.reduce((p, f) =&gt; p.then(f), Promise.resolve(x))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">pipeAsync</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">...fns</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span>) =&gt;</span> fns.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reduce</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">p, f</span>) =&gt;</span> p.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(f), <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">resolve</span>(x))</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p>Function composition <strong>chains small functions into a bigger one</strong>, where each output feeds the next input.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const compose = (...fns) =&gt; (x) =&gt; fns.reduceRight((v, f) =&gt; f(v), x)\nconst pipe    = (...fns) =&gt; (x) =&gt; fns.reduce((v, f) =&gt; f(v), x)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-line